{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, design, and share \u2014 brick by brick.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble beautiful sets and unlock new designs in <strong>Story Mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends and build together in <strong>real-time multiplayer</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your imagination run wild in <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> \u2014 design your own builds, create step-by-step instructions, and upload your creations to the Steam Workshop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse and download  community creations on the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your collection by importing <strong>custom bricks and stickers</strong> to make your builds truly unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're following instructions or building from scratch, every brick clicks into place.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3449470?t=1751059142","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449470/7c1ce14821d9681d9e4166b58f51965cd5a4bcaf/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1751059142","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449470/a2717cda8f60c82183fbef68c3516017a5f417c5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751059142","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449470/a2717cda8f60c82183fbef68c3516017a5f417c5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751059142","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build, design, and share \u2014 brick by brick.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assemble beautiful sets and unlock new designs in <strong>Story Mode</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with friends and build together in <strong>real-time multiplayer</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let your imagination run wild in <strong>Sandbox Mode</strong> \u2014 design your own builds, create step-by-step instructions, and upload your creations to the Steam Workshop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Browse and download  community creations on the <strong>Steam Workshop</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your collection by importing <strong>custom bricks and stickers</strong> to make your builds truly unique.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're following instructions or building from scratch, every brick clicks into place.</p>","developers":["Dry Cactus"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3449470/0dcbb574dfb721ef66c054724f41a5ae775787a4/header.jpg?t=1751059142","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3449470/145217377/167fce7c194016f33721191b2058d7afde2b41ff/1751056919/dash_av1.mpd?t=1751059140","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3449470/145217377/167fce7c194016f33721191b2058d7afde2b41ff/1751056919/dash_h264.mpd?t=1751059140","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3449470/145217377/167fce7c194016f33721191b2058d7afde2b41ff/1751056919/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1751059140","id":257162554,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162554/movie480.mp4?t=1751059140","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257162554/movie_max.mp4?t=1751059140"},"name":"Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257162554/e3f5e570ed12b514d2b2d364a6cecc39cfabb8ba/movie_6